Package: toft
Title: Toft SDK for R
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Larchway Labs", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@toft.local")
Description: The platform's own voice from inside a deployed R app: app data,
    background jobs, integrations, viewer identity and the caller's role. Every
    call needs the environment Toft injects into a deployed app, and says
    so by name when it is missing.
